OL,3,GNEWSAResidents celebrate as
OL,4,Aregeneration scheme scrapped
OL,5,
OL,6,FResident Layla Al-Abhar, from campaign
OL,7,Fgroup, Ladywood Unite, said the news
OL,8,Fthe project is not going ahead has
OL,9,Fchanged everything.
